    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WYS: Write Your Story</strong> is an action-adventure RPG where you begin your journey as a commoner, noble, or bourgeois, determining your social status and starting resources. Level up, upgrade your gear, fight monsters, conquer dungeons, master professions\u2026 or rise to power through alliances and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a merchant, an adventurer, a politician? The choice is yours \u2014 your decisions and actions will shape the world around you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WYS: Write Your Story</strong> is an action-adventure RPG where you begin your journey as a commoner, noble, or bourgeois, determining your social status and starting resources. Level up, upgrade your gear, fight monsters, conquer dungeons, master professions\u2026 or rise to power through alliances and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a merchant, an adventurer, a politician? The choice is yours \u2014 your decisions and actions will shape the world around you.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this open-world RPG, you must choose a path to follow: merchant, adventurer, or politician. But beware, your choices will affect the world you inhabit. Embark on the adventure alone or with friends, and craft your story that will change this world.",
